BT 1 0 0 1 0 42.7 Tm /F1 9.3 Tf 13 TL .421094 Tw (The Online Shopping Cart System is a console-based Java application that lets a user view a product catalogue,) Tj T* 0 Tw .586671 Tw (add products to a shopping cart, view the cart, remove the last added item, sort the cart by item total and check) Tj T* 0 Tw .741283 Tw (out. The program loads the catalogue from a text file at start-up, validates every input, and saves the catalogue) Tj T* 0 Tw (back to the file when the user exits.) Tj T* ET
