.101961 .101961 .101961 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 42.7 Tm /F1 9.3 Tf 13 TL .117476 Tw (This project implements these ideas in one console application. When the user adds a product, the program looks) Tj T* 0 Tw .093771 Tw (up the product ID in the HashMap, creates a cart item with the requested quantity, appends it to the linked list and) Tj T* 0 Tw .611028 Tw (pushes it on the stack. Removing the last added item is a stack pop followed by deleting that node from the list.) Tj T* 0 Tw (Checkout adds up the item totals, records the order and empties the cart.) Tj T* ET
